bench, feet on the floor, no backrest assistance.","Move relaxed bent arms forward/backward from the shoulders within a comfortable sprint-like range.","Hands do not cross the trunk or strike the seat; avoid shrugging or exaggerated rocking.","Complete 2 × 4 continuous arm exchanges, bodyweight; 75 s between sets. One rep switches both arms from their opposing positions to the other positions; 8 total exchanges.; preserve the written recovery before repeating."],"coach_cues":["Preserve the named stance, direction, support, and finish.","Full reset; fast and clean, never fatigued."],"athlete_cues":["Fast, clean, then reset.","Stop if the rep changes or symptoms appear."],"breathing_cues":["Breathe continuously; do not hold the breath to force a rep."],"common_faults":["Shortening recovery and turning quality work into conditioning.","Changing the listed stance, direction, support, landing, or equipment and treating it as the same variation."],"quality_gate":["All prescribed reps match the named setup and finish with stable, repeatable control."],"stop_signs":["Pain, dizziness, unsafe equipment or surface, loss of control, or inability to preserve the named variation."]},"dosage":{"volume_unit":"reps","default_sets":2,"default_reps":4,"default_work_seconds":null,"default_rest_seconds":90,"est_seconds_per_set":45,"default_rpe_min":7,"default_rpe_max":9},"scaling":{"youth_beginner":"Reduce load, range, speed, distance, impact, and decision demand. Use one coached rep at a time and stop at the first loss of control.","youth_intermediate":"Use the written pattern at a conservative dose; progress one variable only after repeated clean sessions.","teen":"Use the class prescription when readiness and technique support it; keep full recovery for explosive work and clean reps in reserve for strength.","adult_beginner":"Begin below the written load, range, or speed and increase only after the exact start and finish remain repeatable.","adult_advanced":"Use the written variation