  ('accelerator-cone-color-call-to-forward-plant-and-chamber', 'Cone-color call to forward plant and chamber', '{"slug":"accelerator-cone-color-call-to-forward-plant-and-chamber","name":"Cone-color call to forward plant and chamber","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Mapped plant → chest push: Identify the chamber side before entry, then use a planned chest push to check stable rotational output without a decision load.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Mapped plant → chest push: Identify the chamber side before entry, then use a planned chest push to check stable rotational output without a decision load. Map a cue to the correct receiving foot before accelerating the free thigh. Use a direct leg-name cue instead if color mapping interferes; shorten entry for any loss of foot/knee alignment.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Cone-color call to forward plant and chamber.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"rotate","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"cones","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Mapped plant → chest push: Identify the chamber side before entry, then use a planned chest push to check stable rotational output without a decision load.","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping befo