  ('accelerator-direction-call-lateral-bound-to-split-catch', 'Direction-call lateral bound to split catch', '{"slug":"accelerator-direction-call-lateral-bound-to-split-catch","name":"Direction-call lateral bound to split catch","family":"Elastic and plyometric output","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"elastic_stiffness_plyometric_rudiments","slot":"accelerator_output_elastic","cardSummary":"Called catch → unloaded sweep: Choose and catch the lateral bound before using an unloaded planned sweep to review the shared base and finish.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Called catch → unloaded sweep: Choose and catch the lateral bound before using an unloaded planned sweep to review the shared base and finish. Select a lateral push while arriving in a stable base for the next rotational effort. Use an announced direction or shorter bound instead if choice disrupts the two-foot catch.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Direction-call lateral bound to split catch.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"cones","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Called catch → unloaded sweep: Choose and catch the lateral bound before using an unloaded planned sweep to review the shared base and finish.","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls. The elastic stiffness plyometric rudime