  ('accelerator-handoff-to-lateral-step-medicine-ball-backhand-return', 'Handoff-to-lateral-step medicine-ball backhand return', '{"slug":"accelerator-handoff-to-lateral-step-medicine-ball-backhand-return","name":"Handoff-to-lateral-step medicine-ball backhand return","family":"Deceleration and change-of-direction output","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"deceleration_cod_power","slot":"accelerator_output_deceleration_cod","cardSummary":"Gathered entry → supplied lateral entry: Uncross and settle the step-behind kick entry, then organize handoff, lateral step and backhand release without rushing the base.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Gathered entry → supplied lateral entry: Uncross and settle the step-behind kick entry, then organize handoff, lateral step and backhand release without rushing the base. Integrate supplied load, deliberate arrival and an outward release. Receive the ball across the lower ribs while stationary. After the feeder fully lets go and is clear, take one small lateral step, plant and turn into a two-hand outward backhand release toward the low target. Finish inside the bay. Use the self-held lateral-step backhand instead if supply timing or feeder clearance is unreliable. Rest 90 s between side bouts/sets.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Handoff-to-lateral-step medicine-ball backhand return.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"pairs","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"rotate","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"