  ('accelerator-lateral-shuffle-to-stick-rapid-entry-variant', 'Lateral Shuffle to Stick — rapid entry variant', '{"slug":"accelerator-lateral-shuffle-to-stick-rapid-entry-variant","name":"Lateral Shuffle to Stick — rapid entry variant","family":"Deceleration and change-of-direction output","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"deceleration_cod_power","slot":"accelerator_output_deceleration_cod","cardSummary":"Isolate rapid force production into a predictable lateral brake so the athlete has a physical stopping strategy for E2. Lower the hips through several controlled braking contacts; avoid a reaching, locked-knee final…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Isolate rapid force production into a predictable lateral brake so the athlete has a physical stopping strategy for E2. Lower the hips through several controlled braking contacts; avoid a reaching, locked-knee final plant. Reduce entry speed if the stopping boundary is missed.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Lateral Shuffle to Stick — rapid entry variant.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"locomote","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"none","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Isolate rapid force production into a predictable lateral brake so the athlete has a physical stopping strategy for E2. Lower the hips through several controlled braking contacts; avoid a reaching, locked-knee final…","whyItGoesHere":