  ('accelerator-low-drop-to-broad-jump', 'Low Drop to Broad Jump', '{"slug":"accelerator-low-drop-to-broad-jump","name":"Low Drop to Broad Jump","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Redirect an externally imposed downward arrival into forward projection. Step off a very low stable box, receive on both feet and immediately jump forward; use the needed knee/hip bend, then hold the final landing 2 s.…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Redirect an externally imposed downward arrival into forward projection. Step off a very low stable box, receive on both feet and immediately jump forward; use the needed knee/hip bend, then hold the final landing 2 s. Regress/stop: Lower the starting step and shorten the forward jump; stop for a stiff/jarring arrival, knee collapse or a deliberate reset between contacts.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Low Drop to Broad Jump.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Redirect an externally imposed downward arrival into forward projection. Step off a very low stable box, receive on both feet and immediately jump forward; use the needed knee/hip bend, then hold the final landing 2 s.…","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using