ing are rechecked."]},"regimen":{"can_be_daily":false,"weekly_max_frequency":4,"minimum_hours_between_hard_exposures":12,"counts_as_high_intensity":false,"counts_as_high_impact":false,"counts_as_neural":false,"counts_as_tissue_stress":true,"counts_as_conditioning":false},"phaseProfile":{"role":"primary","fit_weight":5,"freshness_required":false,"fatigue_cost":2,"fatigue_sensitivity":2,"technical_complexity":2,"impact_level":0,"intensity_ceiling":"moderate"},"videoDonor":"Dumbbell Floor Press"}'::jsonb),
  ('accelerator-parallel-stance-low-roundhouse', 'Parallel-stance low roundhouse', '{"slug":"accelerator-parallel-stance-low-roundhouse","name":"Parallel-stance low roundhouse","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Organize support selection and the hip turn from a neutral two-foot base.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Organize support selection and the hip turn from a neutral two-foot base. Start with both feet parallel in a comfortable athletic stance. Shift onto the support leg and turn its foot/pelvis into one low roundhouse with the other leg; recoil and return to the original parallel base. No preselected front/rear fighting stance or entry step. A qualified coach must establish the low noncontact execution. Keep the foot below hip height, support foot turning with the pelvis, knee softly extended and recoil active; no target impact, jump, spin or locked-knee snap. Use instead: Widen the starting base slightly or reduce the kick arc instead if the athlete needs a rescue step; feet must be free to turn. Apply this change only to the same remaining combined dose and recovery; it replaces the original execution and adds no extra task or make-up attempts. This replacement uses only the remaining combined dose/rest unless explicitly stated; log changed support, event type, load and added time.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Parallel-stance low roundhouse.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],