  ('accelerator-paused-broad-jump-to-stick-hands-on-hips', 'Paused Broad Jump to Stick — hands on hips', '{"slug":"accelerator-paused-broad-jump-to-stick-hands-on-hips","name":"Paused Broad Jump to Stick — hands on hips","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Produce forward force from stillness, separating the leg push from a countermovement and arm contribution. Hands remain on hips; land on two feet and hold 2 s. Shorten distance/start depth if needed. A re-dip…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Produce forward force from stillness, separating the leg push from a countermovement and arm contribution. Hands remain on hips; land on two feet and hold 2 s. Shorten distance/start depth if needed. A re-dip invalidates the static-start task; do not make up the attempt.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Paused Broad Jump to Stick — hands on hips.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"none","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"wrist","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Produce forward force from stillness, separating the leg push from a countermovement and arm contribution. Hands remain on hips; land on two feet and hold 2 s. Shorten distance/start depth if needed. A re-dip…","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopp