  ('accelerator-prone-band-leg-curl-fast-concentric', 'Prone Band Leg Curl — fast concentric', '{"slug":"accelerator-prone-band-leg-curl-fast-concentric","name":"Prone Band Leg Curl — fast concentric","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Accelerate knee flexion for lower-leg recovery while keeping the hip/pelvis still. Prone on a comfortable floor, light band safely attached around the working ankle and a verified low fixed anchor beyond the feet. Flex…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Accelerate knee flexion for lower-leg recovery while keeping the hip/pelvis still. Prone on a comfortable floor, light band safely attached around the working ankle and a verified low fixed anchor beyond the feet. Flex knee quickly only toward 90°, return over 2 s. Keep thighs/pelvis grounded; reduce tension for hip lift or cramping. Secure attachment must not slip or snap toward the athlete.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Prone Band Leg Curl — fast concentric.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"pull","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"bands","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"shoulder","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Accelerate knee flexion for lower-leg recovery while keeping the hip/pelvis still. Prone on a comfortable floor, light band safely attached around the working ankle and a veri