  ('accelerator-retreat-step-hip-open-plant', 'Retreat-step hip-open plant', '{"slug":"accelerator-retreat-step-hip-open-plant","name":"Retreat-step hip-open plant","family":"Deceleration and change-of-direction output","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"deceleration_cod_power","slot":"accelerator_output_deceleration_cod","cardSummary":"Retreat plant → body-and-ball stop: Own the small retreat plant and then the compact retained-ball endpoint; neither task should drift into another turn.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Retreat plant → body-and-ball stop: Own the small retreat plant and then the compact retained-ball endpoint; neither task should drift into another turn. Retain a usable rotational base while receiving backward bodyweight instead of advancing or moving laterally. Use a shorter, slower retreat instead if the athlete cannot see/control the clear route or heels collide.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Retreat-step hip-open plant.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"locomote","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Retreat plant → body-and-ball stop: Own the small retreat plant and then the compact retained-ball endpoint; neither task should drift into another turn.","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls. The deceleration cod power placem