places the original execution and adds no extra task or make-up attempts. This replacement uses only the remaining combined dose/rest unless explicitly stated; log changed support, event type, load and added time.","setup":["Prepare Bodyweight, Cleared movement area; inspect the surface, anchors, clearances, and retrieval path that apply.","Directly convert arriving lateral mass into support-foot/pelvic rotation."],"execution_steps":["Directly convert arriving lateral mass into support-foot/pelvic rotation.","From a kick stance, make one short lateral shuffle toward the support side, settle that foot without an extra stutter and launch the opposite low roundhouse.","Recoil and recover the stance.","Entry and finish stay within 2 m; no target or continuous shuffling.","Complete 1 × 2 per side/direction; preserve the written recovery before repeating."],"coach_cues":["Preserve the named stance, direction, support, and finish.","Full reset; fast and clean, never fatigued."],"athlete_cues":["Fast, clean, then reset.","Stop if the rep changes or symptoms appear."],"breathing_cues":["Breathe continuously; do not hold the breath to force a rep."],"common_faults":["Shortening recovery and turning quality work into conditioning.","Changing the listed stance, direction, support, landing, or equipment and treating it as the same variation."],"quality_gate":["All prescribed reps match the named setup and finish with stable, repeatable control."],"stop_signs":["Pain, dizziness, unsafe equipment or surface, loss of control, or inability to preserve the named variation."]},"dosage":{"volume_unit":"reps","default_sets":1,"default_reps":2,"default_work_seconds":null,"default_rest_seconds":60,"est_seconds_per_set":45,"default_rpe_min":7,"default_rpe_max":9},"scaling":{"youth_beginner":"Reduce load, range, speed, distance, impact, and decision demand. Use one coached rep at a time and stop at the first loss of control.","youth_intermediate":"Use the written pattern at a conservative d