  ('accelerator-split-stance-explosive-hip-pivot-grounded', 'Split-stance explosive hip pivot — grounded', '{"slug":"accelerator-split-stance-explosive-hip-pivot-grounded","name":"Split-stance explosive hip pivot — grounded","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Pivot → scoop: Let the support foot release with the hip turn in the grounded pivot, then retain that foot-led sequence when the hands project the ball.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Pivot → scoop: Let the support foot release with the hip turn in the grounded pivot, then retain that foot-led sequence when the hands project the ball. Isolate the support-foot release and hip-turn initiation before adding a swinging leg. Mirror the stance for the opposite direction. Keep knees soft and following toes; reduce turn size if a foot sticks, knee twists or trunk leads the turn. Stop if the surface will not permit controlled pivoting.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Split-stance explosive hip pivot — grounded.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"rotate","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"cones","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Pivot → scoop: Let the support foot release with the hip turn in the grounded pivot, then retain that foot-led sequence when the hands project the ball.","whyIt