  ('accelerator-standing-a-switch-to-stick-isolated-support-exchange', 'Standing A-Switch to Stick — isolated support exchange', '{"slug":"accelerator-standing-a-switch-to-stick-isolated-support-exchange","name":"Standing A-Switch to Stick — isolated support exchange","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Quickly exchange thigh positions into upright individual support, then stabilize the new position before another attempt. Begin tall on one foot, opposite knee comfortably raised. Make only enough upward push to…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Quickly exchange thigh positions into upright individual support, then stabilize the new position before another attempt. Begin tall on one foot, opposite knee comfortably raised. Make only enough upward push to exchange legs once; place the previously raised foot near its standing position while the original support knee rises. Natural opposing arms, low flight and no extra bounce. Unlike a continuous A-run, every exchange finishes and resets. Reduce knee height/flight for drift, reaching or trunk motion; use the nonflight replacement if control is unsuitable.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Standing A-Switch to Stick — isolated support exchange.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"brace","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"none"