  ('accelerator-standing-broad-jump-dip-project-and-stick', 'Standing Broad Jump — dip, project and stick', '{"slug":"accelerator-standing-broad-jump-dip-project-and-stick","name":"Standing Broad Jump — dip, project and stick","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Direct a coordinated leg push forward, distinct from the vertical still-start task. One controlled dip and arm swing; jump forward from both feet and land on both feet, hold 2 s. Keep start and landing within the marked…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Direct a coordinated leg push forward, distinct from the vertical still-start task. One controlled dip and arm swing; jump forward from both feet and land on both feet, hold 2 s. Keep start and landing within the marked first 3 m and remaining 7 m clear. Recovery: 10 s between individual reps; 90 s before the next exercise/section Use instead: a shorter two-foot projection, or a rapid nonflight squat rise if reception cannot stay organized; record removed landings. This replaces remaining work in this slot; follow an explicit replacement dose if stated, otherwise keep the remaining dose/rest. Log changed events or laterality.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Standing Broad Jump — dip, project and stick.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment