  ('accelerator-step-behind-lateral-bound-to-stick', 'Step-Behind Lateral Bound to Stick', '{"slug":"accelerator-step-behind-lateral-bound-to-stick","name":"Step-Behind Lateral Bound to Stick","family":"Elastic and plyometric output","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"elastic_stiffness_plyometric_rudiments","slot":"accelerator_output_elastic","cardSummary":"Step-behind push → hip reload: Use the step-behind bound to organize lateral push-off, then control the smaller drop-step reload before the scoop release.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Step-behind push → hip reload: Use the step-behind bound to organize lateral push-off, then control the smaller drop-step reload before the scoop release. Produce lateral force after a compact cross-behind load, before adding a kick task. Keep the crossing step shallow and feet clear; use a shorter step-behind instead for tangling or a heavy landing.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Step-Behind Lateral Bound to Stick.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Step-behind push → hip reload: Use the step-behind bound to organize lateral push-off, then control the smaller drop-step reload before the scoop release.","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls. The elastic stiffness plyomet