  ('accelerator-step-behind-rotational-slam-ball-slam', 'Step-Behind Rotational Slam Ball Slam', '{"slug":"accelerator-step-behind-rotational-slam-ball-slam","name":"Step-Behind Rotational Slam Ball Slam","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Uncross → rotational output: Finish the crossover chamber and step-behind slam entries with uncrossed feet before turning; retain each source travel limit.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Uncross → rotational output: Finish the crossover chamber and step-behind slam entries with uncrossed feet before turning; retain each source travel limit. Direct entry momentum into a downward diagonal hand finish. Use one small step-behind and lead-foot replant, then turn and slam a light non-rebounding ball slightly forward/outside the lead foot. No overhead windmill or jump; wait until the ball settles. Use the stationary side slam instead at the same dose if crossing placement is unreliable. Rest 90 s between side bouts/sets.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Step-Behind Rotational Slam Ball Slam.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"rotate","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"slam_ball","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"shoulder","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Uncross → rotational output: Finish the crossover chamber and step-behind slam entr