  ('accelerator-step-through-medicine-ball-chest-pass', 'Step-through Medicine Ball Chest Pass', '{"slug":"accelerator-step-through-medicine-ball-chest-pass","name":"Step-through Medicine Ball Chest Pass","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Match forward weight transfer to a two-arm release. From a staggered stance, step the rear foot forward while driving a light ball from the chest; finish balanced without chasing the throw. Regress/stop: Slow/shorten…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Match forward weight transfer to a two-arm release. From a staggered stance, step the rear foot forward while driving a light ball from the chest; finish balanced without chasing the throw. Regress/stop: Slow/shorten the step and reduce ball load; stop if the body falls through the release.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Step-through Medicine Ball Chest Pass.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"brace","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"medicine_ball","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Match forward weight transfer to a two-arm release. From a staggered stance, step the rear foot forward while driving a light ball from the chest; finish balanced without chasing the throw. Regress/stop: Slow/shorten…","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fr