  ('accelerator-step-up-step-on-entry-explosive-knee-drive', 'Step-Up — step-on entry, explosive knee drive', '{"slug":"accelerator-step-up-step-on-entry-explosive-knee-drive","name":"Step-Up — step-on entry, explosive knee drive","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Load a newly placed lead foot, then drive rapidly upward through that leg with a supported elevated target. Start close to a low stable box, place the whole lead foot on it each rep, accept the plant under control, then…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Load a newly placed lead foot, then drive rapidly upward through that leg with a supported elevated target. Start close to a low stable box, place the whole lead foot on it each rep, accept the plant under control, then rise briskly as the free knee lifts. Lower the free foot to the floor, step the lead foot off and reset. The lead foot stays on the box during the rise: no flight, jumping onto/off the box or pronounced trailing-leg push. Use secure light hand support; lower the step or use the preplanted replacement if balance slows the drive.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Step-Up — step-on entry, explosive knee drive.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"squat","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":