  ('accelerator-supported-fast-chamber-lift-to-a-fixed-stop', 'Supported fast chamber lift to a fixed stop', '{"slug":"accelerator-supported-fast-chamber-lift-to-a-fixed-stop","name":"Supported fast chamber lift to a fixed stop","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Chamber stop → band-cross stop: Stop the supported chamber at its chosen height and the cross before elbow lock, with the pelvis and ribs controlled.","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Chamber stop → band-cross stop: Stop the supported chamber at its chosen height and the cross before elbow lock, with the pelvis and ribs controlled. Practice cutting off free-thigh acceleration at the selected chamber, supporting a consistent low kick trajectory. Use a lower stop point instead if the pelvis tips or the leg overshoots; do not force end-range holds.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Supported fast chamber lift to a fixed stop.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"rotate","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"bench","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Chamber stop → band-cross stop: Stop the supported chamber at its chosen height and the cross before elbow lock, with the pelvis and ribs controlled.","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping