  ('accelerator-two-step-approach-broad-jump', 'Two-step Approach Broad Jump', '{"slug":"accelerator-two-step-approach-broad-jump","name":"Two-step Approach Broad Jump","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Redirect a small amount of forward entry momentum through a two-foot takeoff. Take exactly two controlled forward steps into a two-foot plant, swing the arms and jump forward; hold the bilateral finish 2 s.…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Redirect a small amount of forward entry momentum through a two-foot takeoff. Take exactly two controlled forward steps into a two-foot plant, swing the arms and jump forward; hold the bilateral finish 2 s. Regress/stop: Slow/shorten the entry; stop if braking or an extra shuffle replaces the plant.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Two-step Approach Broad Jump.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"plyometrics","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"ssc_stiffness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"jump","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"hip","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Redirect a small amount of forward entry momentum through a two-foot takeoff. Take exactly two controlled forward steps into a two-foot plant, swing the arms and jump forward; hold the bilateral finish 2 s.…","whyItGoesHere":"Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls. The jump th