  ('accelerator-wall-drill-double-switch-paired-exchanges', 'Wall Drill Double Switch — paired exchanges', '{"slug":"accelerator-wall-drill-double-switch-paired-exchanges","name":"Wall Drill Double Switch — paired exchanges","family":"Jump, throw, and explosive power","primaryPhaseKey":"output","subrole":"jump_throw_explosive_power","slot":"accelerator_output_jump_throw","cardSummary":"Keep an inclined support line through two successive leg exchanges, rather than stopping after each strike. Both hands press a verified immovable wall; begin with one knee comfortably lifted. Switch supports twice,…","bestPlacement":"Use in the Accelerator output block with the listed dose and recovery. Express speed or power while fresh, using full recovery and stopping before output quality falls.","description":"Keep an inclined support line through two successive leg exchanges, rather than stopping after each strike. Both hands press a verified immovable wall; begin with one knee comfortably lifted. Switch supports twice, finishing with the original knee raised; keep the hips level, steps near their starting positions and elbows steady. Eight fast foot contacts plus four controlled set-downs in total. Step out of the lean for recovery. Shorten the range/lean if feet slide or the torso sags.","coachLanguage":"This card represents the exact Accelerator-listed identity “Wall Drill Double Switch — paired exchanges.” Preserve its declared stance, direction, support, landing or receiving condition, and equipment boundary.","athleteLanguage":"Make every effort fast and clean; reset fully before the next one.","participantStructure":"individual","tenets":[{"key":"explosiveness","weight":5}],"methodologies":[{"key":"neural","weight":5}],"physiology":[{"key":"neural_output_readiness","weight":5}],"patterns":[{"key":"brace","weight":5}],"equipment":[{"key":"box","weight":5}],"body_regions":[{"key":"full_body","weight":5}],"whyItWorks":"Keep an inclined support line through two successive leg